    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b80fab47_22d051f9",
        "filename": "core/java/android/os/BugreportParams.java",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 30,
      "author": {
        "id": 1336554
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-12-13T12:59:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I want to remove the int modes in the future (will try for Q, but most likely next release), and provide flags like take_screenshot, add_wifi_section, while keeping the prefilled options etc. So I didn\u0027t want to expose the int modes in the API. This was an explicit effort to hide the modes while giving people a way to specify what options they want. Later I can swap out the implementation of BUGREPORT_PARAMS_FULL to use flags and not int mode, without affecting API.\n\nIs the extra objects the concern? Can make them factory methods instead.",
      "parentUuid": "72a06781_6d7d218a",
